{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t西營盤晚上發生火警，一名年約70歲男子昏迷送往瑪麗醫院治理。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方晚上約9時接報，薄扶林道恆輝大廈一個單位起火，現時已經救熄。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T14:42:03.088653+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":70,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:13:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T18:57:53.664361+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T14:39:16.497914+00:00","content_hash":"6c701174b987047ce96460b1f0285ef9ba4a4162a947db184598f16ff2d6f593","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}